        "metadata": {
          "hidden": false,
          "category": "stories",
          "minAge": 8,
          "maxAge": 12,
          "media": {
            "duration": 15566,
            "fileSize": 189922878
          },
          "author": "Madeline Roux",
          "description": "Welcome to Dungeon Academy, where monsters and creatures train for the dark world that awaits just beyond the dungeon walls. But Zellidora \"Zelli\" Stormclash isn't a monster or a creature. She is something far worse. Zelli is a human. \n\nDisguised as a minotaur, Zelli keeps to herself and does her work. While in class, Zelli learns of the great human adventurer, Allidora Steelstrike, who oddly resembles her. Could Zelli also be a Steelstrike? Seeking answers to her true lineage, Zelli embarks on a dangerous adventure. But she won't be alone. \n\nA vegan owlbear, a cowardly kobold, and a shapeshifting mimic will join Zelli on her quest for truth. And who knows, perhaps these monstrous misfits may discover truths of their own...",
          "previewAudio": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0051/8845/2401/files/dungeons-dragons-dungeon-academy-no-humans-allowed-middle-grade-book-1-digital.mp3",
